    "description": "\n[[]#fed570]Delivarica...[[]][[]#ffffff][[]] Everyone loves a good campaign on a brand-new planet. We know how annoying those [[]#fed570]cookie-cutter JSON mods[[]][[]#ffffff][[]] can get, so... Our mod brings a full-fledged playable planet to the table:\n\n• [[]#fed570]Brand-new, unique mechanics[[]][[]#ffffff][[]] (WIP)\n• [[]#fed570]40+ sectors[[]][[]#ffffff][[]] (WIP)\n• [[]#fed570]Custom polished visuals[[]][[]#ffffff][[]] (WIP)\n\nWe really went all out to pack this with as much awesome gameplay as possible. As this is our team's [[]#fed570]first-ever Java project[[]][[]#ffffff][[]], we'd hugely appreciate any feedback you've got!\n    \n\n    [[]#ffffff]-[[]] [[]#fed570] AUTHORS[[]] [[]#ffffff]-[[]]\n\n    [[]#ffffff][[]] [[]#787878]Splinter[[]]  (Split)[[]#ffffff][[]] \n    [[]#ffffff][[]]i[[]#d6cc94]Ð[[]][[]#cfbd5b]u[[]][[]#d1b930]p[[]#ffca2b]e[[]][[]#ffffff][[]]\n    [[]#bd0029]Charizard[[]][[]#ffffff][[]]\n    [[]#0052f7]Me[[]][[]#39a5f7]ch[[]][[]#39bbf7]an[[]][[]#00f7d2]ic[[]][[]#ffffff][[]]\n    [[]#6ae861]Yartera[[]][[]#ffffff][[]]\n    [[]#b681db]深[[]][[]#4d2e63]淵[[]][[]#ffffff][[]]\n\n\n    [[]#ffffff]-[[]] [[]#fed570] SPECIAL THANKS [[]#ffffff]-[[]]\n\n    [[]#fed570][[]] [[]#ffffff]Bloody Ocean[[]]\n    [[]#fed570][[]] [[]#ffffff]Afarius[[]]\n",
